Package: dstatree
Title: Tree-Aware Filtering of D-Statistic Tables
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: person("Your", "Ruben Muller-Perol", email = "rubenmullerperol@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Filters tables of D-statistic (ABBA-BABA) results so that only
    trios consistent with a rooted species tree are kept, using a single
    object that stores the tree and the table. Also reports significant
    signals involving true sister species pairs.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: ape, methods, stats, utils
